<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-corruption="<%= corruptionLevel %>">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title><%= title %></title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>

<div class="static-layer"></div>
<div class="dust"></div>

<%- include('partials/header', { active: 'about' }) %>

<div class="page-head">
  <h2>About Mystic Museum</h2>
</div>

<div class="lore" style="margin-top:30px; position:relative;">
  <p>The Mystic Museum is dedicated to preserving and showcasing the hidden history and culture of mysticism and the supernatural. Our exhibits feature artifacts of great power and importance, some of which could threaten the balance of this world, should they fall into the wrong hands.</p>

  <h3 style="margin-top:34px;">Our Founder</h3>
  <p>Our founder, Dr. Archie Lockheart, was a renowned historian, mystic and occultist. He spent his life uncovering secrets that lie beyond the veil. He tragically passed away in 1969 under mysterious circumstances. Police ruled it a suicide, but many believe there was more to the story.</p>

  <h3 style="margin-top:34px;">Our Philosophy</h3>
  <p style="text-align:center;">Preserve those that came before us. Protect those that come after us.</p>

  <h3 style="margin-top:34px;">The Runes</h3>
  <p>Our artifacts contain great power. For this reason, they have each been placed under a protective seal. Those with a keen eye may find the runes scattered throughout this museum to lift each seal and behold what lies beneath.</p>

  <p class="final-line">Beware, the Abyss watches back.</p>

  <% if (!isUnlocked('reliquary')) { %>
    <form method="POST" action="/unlock/reliquary">
      <button type="submit" class="rune-hidden" style="position:absolute; top:8px; right:8px; width:22px; height:22px;" aria-label="A faint rune. Something is carved here."><%- runeSVG(artifactsBySlug['reliquary'].runeKey, 'var(--gold-bright)') %></button>
    </form>
  <% } %>
</div>

<% if (!isUnlocked('sigil')) { %>
  <form method="POST" action="/unlock/sigil" style="text-align:center;">
    <button type="submit" class="rune-hidden" style="position:relative; display:inline-block; width:26px; height:26px; margin-bottom:60px;" aria-label="A faint rune. Something is carved here."><%- runeSVG(artifactsBySlug['sigil'].runeKey, 'var(--gold-bright)') %></button>
  </form>
<% } %>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>
</html>
